--   * person, organisation, role_edge: tenant tables (tenantTable()) under FORCE RLS with
--     ws_isolation (tenantPolicy()). person and role_edge carry provenance() and provenanceCheck();
--     organisation does not. Grants come from the default privileges (app: 02-roles.sql, clerk: 0022).
--   * person.contact is only for clients and professional contacts (PRD §9): person_contact_chk.
--   * role_edge runs from a person to exactly one target (num_nonnulls(to_person_id, matter_id,
